PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..1" DuToanChiPhi
DuToanChiPhi "1" -- "0..*" DuBaoChiPhi
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" ChiPhiThucTe
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" DanhGiaChiPhi
DanhGiaChiPhi "0..*" -- "1" NganSach
NganSach "1" -- "0..*" ChiPhiThucTe
DuAn "1" -- "0..*" NganSach
DanhGiaChiPhi "1" *-- "0..*" NguyenNhanVuot
DanhGiaChiPhi "1" *-- "0..1" HuongXuLy
DanhGiaChiPhi "1" -- "0..1" SoSanhPhuongAn
SoSanhPhuongAn "1" *-- "2..*" ChiTietSoSanh
ChiTietSoSanh "0..*" -- "1" PhuongAnBoTri
KetQuaDuBao "1" *-- "0..*" TongHopNguonCung
KetQuaDuBao "1" *-- "0..*" NhuCauDuBao
KetQuaDuBao "1" *-- "0..*" DongDoiChieuCungCau
TongHopNguonCung "0..*" -- "1" NguonLuc
NhuCauDuBao "0..*" -- "0..1" NhuCauNguonLuc
PhanHoiNhuCau "0..*" -- "0..1" KetQuaDuBao
@enduml
